| **bundle-store** | Service | Go | `:8307`. Registry of curated, inheritable **session bundles** — named sets of skills + tools, with optional model/effort defaults, selected for a session by repo tags plus task tags — plus the `/resolve` composition endpoint. Members are stored as skill-store and tool-store **ids**, with names carried alongside for display only. |
